# Trivy ignore file for the kubeseal-webgui-ui image only.
#
# Intentionally empty: as of this writing kubeseal-webgui-ui (built on
# quay.io/nginx/nginx-unprivileged, Alpine-based) scans at 0 CRITICAL/HIGH/
# MEDIUM findings. Kept as its own file (rather than sharing
# .trivyignore.api) because a plain Trivy ignore file suppresses a CVE ID
# globally across every image it is passed to, and the API image's
# Debian-package exceptions have no relationship to this Alpine-based image.
# If this image ever needs a genuinely-unfixed-CVE exception, add it here
# following the same format and rules documented in .trivyignore.api's
# header.
